.TH AVR\-RUN\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.1.4" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-run-list \- List workflow runs for an organization.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr run list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List workflow runs for an organization.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr run list
    avr run list --status failure --limit 5
    avr run list --status in_progress --json status,conclusion,head_branch
    avr run list --branch main --status completed
    avr run list --since 24h
    avr run list --json '?'           # list available fields
    avr run list --json '*'           # all fields
    avr run list --json status,conclusion -q '[.[] | select(.status == "completed")]'
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    conclusion, created_at, display_title, duration_seconds, event,
    head_branch, head_sha, platform_run_id, repository, run_attempt, run_id,
    run_number, status, triggering_actor, updated_at, workflow, workflow_id
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by repository (org/repo or rep-xxx, repeatable). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted. (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Filter by state (queued, in_progress, completed) or conclusion (success, failure, ...). Repeatable. (choices: action_required, cancelled, completed, failure, in_progress, neutral, queued, skipped, stale, startup_failure, success, timed_out; repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by head branch (repeatable). (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-workflow\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by workflow ID (wfl-xxx, repeatable). (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fITEXT\fR
Relative time window: '7d', '24h', etc. Sugar for --created-after.
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR, \fB\-\-created\-after\fR \fITEXT\fR
Only runs created after this ISO timestamp.
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR, \fB\-\-created\-before\fR \fITEXT\fR
Only runs created before this ISO timestamp.
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max runs to return. (default: 20)
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\fR \fITEXT\fR
Pagination cursor from a previous response.
.TP
\fB\-\-order\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Sort order. (choices: created_at.desc, created_at.asc; default: created_at.desc)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.TP
\fB\-\-web\fR
Open in browser.
.SH SEE ALSO
